      "source_example_id": "e-21684",
      "knowledge_point": "Determining the Order of a Numerical Method By Comparing GTE for Different Step Sizes",
      "kp_id": "e-21684"
    },
    "q-334546": {
      "dom_id": "step-q334546",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "A numerical method is used to approximate the solution to an initial value problem.\n\n- With step size $Δx=0.18,$ the observed global truncation error is $e(0.18)=0.486.$\n\n- With step size $Δx=0.06,$ the observed global truncation error is $e(0.06)=0.006.$\n\nUse this data to estimate the order of the numerical method.",
      "worked_solution": "A numerical method has order $p$ if $p$ is the largest positive integer such that the global truncation error (GTE) satisfies\n\n$$\ne(Δx)=O\\,((Δx)^{p})\\,\\text{as}\\,Δx\\to 0.\n$$\n\nThe order describes how fast errors shrink as $Δx$ decreases.\n\nIn other words, a numerical method has order $p$ if, for sufficiently small step sizes, reducing the step size by a factor of $k$ reduces the GTE by a factor of approximately ${k}^{p}.$\n\nIn our case, the step size decreases from $0.18$ to $0.06.$ So, it reduces by a factor of\n\n$$\nk=\\frac{0.18}{0.06}=3.\n$$\n\nAs a result, for a numerical method of order $p,$ the GTE should decrease by a factor of approximately\n\n$$\n{k}^{p}={3}^{p}.\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, the GTE actually decreases from $0.486$ to $0.006.$ So, it reduces by a factor of\n\n$$\n\\frac{0.486}{0.006}=81.\n$$\n\nComparing the two scale factors for the GTE, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{3}^{p} & ≈81 \\\\ p & ≈{log}_{3}⁡(81) \\\\ p & ≈4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the approximate order of the method is $4.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-334546-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "0",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"246\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
